        THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): a bare "must state ... and must contain"; QB: NOTHING (O 3 r 2(4)) / other: JUST FALSE

-- src:6843 | (3) Any application to extend the period to set aside the registration of the Direction, Notice or Decision (whether as originally fixed or as subsequently extended) must be made before the expiry of that period.
