DECLARE `o 57 r 7(3) notice of registration` HAS
    `o 57 r 7(3)(a) states full particulars of the Direction, Notice or Decision registered and the order for registration` IS A BOOLEAN
    `o 57 r 7(3)(b) states the name and address of the party seeking to enforce it or of that party's solicitor on whom summonses may be served` IS A BOOLEAN
    `o 57 r 7(3)(c) states that the party against whom it has been made has a right to apply to have the registration set aside` IS A BOOLEAN
    `o 57 r 7(3)(d) states the period within which an application to set aside the registration may be made` IS A BOOLEAN

-- src:6849 | (3) The notice of registration must state — ( a )
-- src:6850 | full particulars of the Direction, Notice or Decision registered and the order for registration;
-- src:6851 | ( b )
-- src:6852 | the name and address of the party seeking to enforce the Direction, Notice or Decision or of the party’s solicitor on whom, and at which, any summons issued by the party against whom the Direction, Notice or Decision (as the case may be) has been made may be served;
-- src:6853 | ( c )
