GIVEN notice IS A `o 57 r 7(3) notice of registration`
GIVETH A LIST OF STRING
`o 57 r 7(3) the matters the notice has not yet stated` MEANS
    concat (LIST
        (IF notice's `o 57 r 7(3)(a) states full particulars of the Direction, Notice or Decision registered and the order for registration` THEN EMPTY ELSE LIST "(a) full particulars of the Direction, Notice or Decision registered and the order for registration"),
        (IF notice's `o 57 r 7(3)(b) states the name and address of the party seeking to enforce it or of that party's solicitor on whom summonses may be served` THEN EMPTY ELSE LIST "(b) the name and address of the party seeking to enforce the Direction, Notice or Decision or of the party's solicitor on whom, and at which, any summons may be served"),
        (IF notice's `o 57 r 7(3)(c) states that the party against whom it has been made has a right to apply to have the registration set aside` THEN EMPTY ELSE LIST "(c) that the party against whom the Direction, Notice or Decision has been made has a right to apply to have the registration set aside"),
        (IF notice's `o 57 r 7(3)(d) states the period within which an application to set aside the registration may be made` THEN EMPTY ELSE LIST "(d) the period within which an application to set aside the registration may be made"))

